WEBVTT

NOTE Module: HTML & CSS

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.355
Module 2 covers semantic markup and modern CSS layouts. Semantic HTML establishes an accessible document tree that works seamlessly across assistive technology.

2
00:00:11.355 --> 00:00:22.829
Here we define a responsive dashboard layout using CSS Grid. With repeat, auto fit, and minmax, the layout adapts fluidly without requiring hardcoded media queries.

3
00:00:22.829 --> 00:00:31.866
Avoid replacing buttons with clickable divs. Doing so strips away keyboard navigation, focus management, and accessibility roles.

4
00:00:31.866 --> 00:00:40.997
Ensure your components meet WCAG double-A standards before submitting your practice lab. This completes the core requirements for Module 2.
